# Shop layer → ecommerce-brain

Applies only when `plan.md` Layer is shop; in any other layer ignore this file.

web-brain no longer defines the shop. In a shop project, run `node scripts/shop.mjs add <project>` in **ecommerce-brain**: it replaces this file with the full shop rules (Supabase on Cloudflare or Firebase on Vercel, pay on delivery, customer accounts, the admin, 37 build units, QA and launch checklists, customer-data rules).

If you are reading this text, the shop add-on is missing: stop and tell the user. Never build a cart, checkout, orders or an admin from memory.
